<title>USA: Muskego-Norway SD, Wis., won by R.W. Baird.</title>
<headline>Muskego-Norway SD, Wis., won by R.W. Baird.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>R.W. Baird &amp; Co. said it won $5.500 million of Muskego-Norway SD, Wis., general obligation school building bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.363 percent.</p>
